<amll:meta key="album" value="但我正在想你"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1755872692"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:30.718"><div begin="12.856" end="38.694" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="12.856" end="18.887" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.856" end="13.287">我早</span><span begin="13.287" end="15.359">习惯副驾空</span><span begin="15.359" end="15.999">着位</span> <span begin="15.999" end="16.564">想起你</span><span begin="16.564" end="16.988">叫</span><span begin="16.988" end="17.433">我别</span><span begin="17.433" end="18.046">空着</span><span begin="18.046" end="18.887">胃</span></p><p begin="19.443" end="22.077" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.443" end="19.729">Tell</span> <span begin="19.729" end="19.931">me</span> <span begin="19.931" end="20.116">what</span> <span begin="20.116" end="20.358">to</span> <span begin="20.358" end="22.077">do</span></p><p begin="22.553" end="25.587" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.553" end="22.748">God,</span> <span begin="22.748" end="22.938">tell</span> <span begin="22.938" end="23.174">me</span> <span begin="23.174" end="23.392">what</span> <span begin="23.392" end="23.606">to</span> <span begin="23.606" end="25.587">do</span></p><p begin="25.837" end="32.078" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.837" end="26.460">后照镜</span><span begin="26.460" end="28.439">穿越过第几</span><span begin="28.439" end="28.996">条街</span> <span begin="29.111" end="29.685">迷样的</span><span begin="29.685" end="31.226">雾 我迷了</span><span begin="31.226" end="32.078">路</span></p><p begin="32.442" end="35.283" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.442" end="32.668">And</span> <span begin="32.668" end="32.836">now</span> <span begin="32.836" end="33.095">I'm</span> <span begin="33.095" end="33.394">missing</span> <span begin="33.394" end="35.283">you</span></p><p begin="35.660" end="38.694" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.660" end="35.855">God,</span> <span begin="35.855" end="36.045">tell</span> <span begin="36.045" end="36.281">me</span> <span begin="36.281" end="36.499">what</span> <span begin="36.499" end="36.713">to</span> <span begin="36.713" end="38.694">do</span></p></div><div begin="39.625" end="1:07.856" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="39.625" end="45.240" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.625" end="42.022">本来计划好的</span><span begin="42.022" end="42.792">每一</span><span begin="42.792" end="45.240">步</span></p><p begin="45.773" end="52.452" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.773" end="46.176">没想</span><span begin="46.176" end="47.733">过你突然</span><span begin="47.733" end="48.061">就</span><span begin="48.061" end="49.008">退出</span> <span begin="49.285" end="51.102">我告诉自己</span><span begin="51.102" end="51.728">不许</span><span begin="51.728" end="52.452">哭</span></p><p begin="52.763" end="58.540" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.763" end="55.225">遗憾正在悄悄</span><span begin="55.225" end="55.459">地</span><span begin="55.459" end="55.943">加</span><span begin="55.943" end="58.540">速</span></p><p begin="59.062" end="1:07.856" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.062" end="59.357">才</span><span begin="59.357" end="1:00.986">惊觉漏掉</span><span begin="1:00.986" end="1:01.204">的</span><span begin="1:01.204" end="1:02.121">幸福</span> <span begin="1:02.351" end="1:04.216">也该学会了</span><span begin="1:04.216" end="1:05.012">认</span><span begin="1:05.012" end="1:07.856">输</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.938" end="1:43.787" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:08.938" end="1:15.417" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.938" end="1:09.837">我以为</span><span begin="1:09.837" end="1:10.426">我</span><span begin="1:10.426" end="1:12.203">早已无所谓</span> <span begin="1:12.444" end="1:13.076">离开</span><span begin="1:13.076" end="1:13.694">后</span><span begin="1:13.694" end="1:15.417">我终于发现</span></p><p begin="1:15.427" end="1:17.895" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.427" end="1:15.656">How</span> <span begin="1:15.656" end="1:15.841">I'm<